WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.082
The bar chart gives a fast estimate for a seven-billion-parameter dense model.

00:00:05.082 --> 00:00:10.002
At F P thirty-two, raw weights are about twenty-eight gigabytes.

00:00:10.002 --> 00:00:13.727
At F P sixteen, about fourteen gigabytes.

00:00:13.727 --> 00:00:19.890
Eight-bit weights are roughly seven gigabytes, and four-bit weights are roughly three and a half gigabytes.

00:00:20.474 --> 00:00:23.856
These numbers describe raw weight storage only.

00:00:23.856 --> 00:00:31.161
Real inference needs additional memory for the K V cache, temporary buffers, framework overhead,

00:00:31.161 --> 00:00:32.999
and other runtime structures.
